{"id":"wb-5-343","name":"嘉应观","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"嘉应观","text":"嘉应观位于中国河南省焦作市武陟县嘉应观乡杨庄村南，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n嘉应观始建于清雍正元年（1723年），为雍正帝敕建的“淮黄诸河龙王庙”。现存建筑五十座，占地一百四十亩，分南北两院。北院中轴线上有山门、御碑亭、严殿、大王殿、恭仪亭、禹王阁，两侧有掖门、御马亭、钟鼓楼、更衣殿、龙王殿、风神殿、雨神殿等建筑。南院仅存戏楼。\n傅作义及苏联专家治理黄河指挥部也曾设在嘉应观内。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%98%89%E5%BA%94%E8%A7%82","revisionId":92235810,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92235810","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/04a797697a740510b8014f83.jpg","title":"20210701_Gate_of_Jiayingguan_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20210701_Gate_of_Jiayingguan_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/20210701_Gate_of_Jiayingguan_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Gate of Jiayingguan","width":320,"height":213}}